  "title": "Enhanced Workbenches",
  "description": "Better crafting solutions through the ages brought onto Modern Minecraft.",
  "body": "<center><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://imgur.com/KoS1gYy.png\" width=\"1000\" /></center>\n<br>\n<center><img src=\"https://imgur.com/586mulZ.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"106\" /></center>\n<br>\n<center>This mod is part of the RED LOGIC series.</center>\n<center><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/logicates\">Logicates</a> &bull; Enhanced Workbenches</span></center>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n\n**Enhanced Workbenches** adds two improved Crafting Tables, capable of storing the items inside them:\n\n\n&bull; <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://imgur.com/hH7hLsm.png\" width=\"32\" />**Project Table:** Has additional two rows to store items, assisting you through all your microcrafting adventures;\n\n&bull; <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://imgur.com/vXgs1W8.png\" width=\"32\" />**Crafting Station:** Budget, yet enhanced; capable of storing items the items inside permanently.\n\n\n<u>**Features**</u>\n\n- Featuring RedPower 2's Project Table;\n- Featuring TiC's Crafting Station;\n- Items shown in-world, fully configurable;\n- Full [EMI](https://modrinth.com/mod/emi/) integration;\n- Full [Roughly Enough Items](https://modrinth.com/mod/rei) integration;\n- Full [Crafting Tweaks](https://modrinth.com/mod/crafting-tweaks/) integration.\n\n<u>**Discord**</u>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/G4PjhEf\"> <img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/707435077679841350/embed.png?style=banner2&amp;v=2\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\" /> </a></p>",
